# Wallust generated files
# The 5 core colorscheme files per profile are tracked on purpose so a fresh
# clone loads without "module 'colors/colors' not found" before any wallpaper
# is applied. wallust still overwrites them when you set a wallpaper.
Asus Laptop/.config/hypr/colors/hyprlock-colors.conf
Desktop/.config/hypr/colors/hyprlock-colors.conf
Asus Laptop/.config/hypr/colors/current-wallpaper.conf
Desktop/.config/hypr/colors/current-wallpaper.conf
**/foot/colors-dark.ini
